  "title": "Women’s and Girls’ Rights - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "To provide a forum for informed, open and constructive discussion of issues affecting the rights of women and girls in Wales. The group will bring together Members of the Senedd, experts and stakeholders to share evidence and to consider the legal and policy framework for women’s and girls’ rights and its implications for devolved policy and practice.",
